  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in compact deterministic specifications. The policy gives forward motion priority in clear space, allows only brief random-walk perturbations after successful forward progress, routes every obstacle event through dedicated recovery states, uses backward motion only for front-obstacle escape, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort stuck state after repeated front blockage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability in G",
    "Use one main policy specification plus a small alternation specification to bias coverage while keeping forward progress dominant"
